flowchart LR
    A[Git Commit] --> B[Pre-Commit Hooks]
    
    B --> C[Gitleaks]
    C --> D{Secrets Found?}
    D -->|Yes| E[Commit Blocked]
    D -->|No| F[dotnet tool restore]
    
    F --> G[CSharpier Format]
    G --> H{Format OK?}
    H -->|No| E
    H -->|Yes| I[dotnet build]
    
    I --> J{Build OK?}
    J -->|No| E
    J -->|Yes| K[dotnet test]
    
    K --> L{Tests Pass?}
    L -->|No| E
    L -->|Yes| M[Commit Successful]